<title>USA: NU plans to continue power generation.</title>
<headline>NU plans to continue power generation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northeast Utilities' Western Massachusetts Electric Co subsidiary has told state regulators the utility has no plans to divest itself of genration assets in connection with a restructuring plan, NU's 10K said.</p>
<p>It noted the regulators have ordered each electric utility operating in the state to develop unbundled rates, which the NU subsidiary filed with the Department of Public Utilities on March 3. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
